<title>USA: Interstate Hotels Co Q3 pro forma shr rises.</title>
<headline>Interstate Hotels Co Q3 pro forma shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>(in thousands except per share amounts)</p>
<p>		    Pro Forma Three Months  Pro Forma Nine Months</p>
<p>				 Ended Sept. 30,     Ended Sept. 30,</p>
<p>				1995	   1996     1995	1996</p>
<p> Total revenues	 64,311	 71,041   194,785   214,426</p>
<p>   Net Income (loss)   3,954	  7,444    12,102    20,106</p>
<p> Net income per share   0.14	   0.26	0.42	0.70</p>
<p>Common shares</p>
<p>  outstanding	   28,794	 28,794    28,773    28,773</p>
<p> EBITDA		   17,947	 22,964    54,497    67,484</p>
<p>NOTE - Company went public on June 29, 1996. Pro forma results assume that the IPO and related transaction, and the acquisition of seven additional hotels acquired through September 30, 1995, had occurred on January 1, 1995.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
